go-ps has no OpenBSD implementation and the upstream repository
(mitchellh/go-ps) is archived; the unmerged PR adding one requires cgo and
libkvm. Replace it with a small pure-Go fork that stubs out process
listing on OpenBSD -- the only caller reachable from flux's dependency
graph is a cosmetic Cloud Foundry Garden container detection check
(gonvenience/term.IsGardenContainer), never true on OpenBSD anyway.
https://github.com/virtualroot/go-ps

